# ── Tenant overlay (GP-191 Stage 2 — see seam in research_areas/private) ────
# org/ is a substrate-agnostic kernel primitive (publishable as standalone).
# ZTARE Research Co's instantiation lives in the sibling private repo
# `ztare-research-co/tenants/ztare/` and is symlinked into the conventional
# org/ paths by `ztare-research-co/scripts/setup_tenant.sh`.
# These rules prevent the symlinks (and any future tenant content) from
# entering public history. Fresh public clone has no tenant overlay
# → kernel runs in kernel-only mode (GP-191 Stage 3 verification).

# ZTARE-specific role contracts (instantiation, not kernel)
org/roles/research_director.yaml
org/roles/product_manager.yaml
org/roles/debate_runner.yaml

# ZTARE-specific preference values (the schema stays at org/preferences/templates/)
org/preferences/principal.yaml

# Reserved for future tenant overlays (one tenant per subdir)
tenants/*/
!tenants/.gitkeep
!tenants/README.md
